title: Design Paradigm Conductor — multimodal mission control for Claude Code
summary: Fully specced Paradigm Conductor, a native macOS floating overlay that lets you speak commands into a staging buffer, edit with hand gestures, target Claude Code windows with gaze tracking, and dispatch enriched prompts — all with zero paid APIs, zero cloud dependencies, and one-command setup. This is the most ambitious addition to Paradigm yet, turning it from a developer toolchain into a full human-AI interaction layer.
